{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training \u00d7 Harem \u00d7 Board Game Madness!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/a0c10d25c0757fa66601ec7a8036e012.poster.avif?t=1761795945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/a0c10d25c0757fa66601ec7a8036e012.webm?t=1761795945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/a0c10d25c0757fa66601ec7a8036e012.mp4?t=1761795945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all 18 layers of hell and seduce every demoness commander you meet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Roguelite \u00d7 Zero Frustration</strong> \u2014 Grow stronger with every run. Permanent upgrades, stable progress, and no jail time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luck Is Power!</strong><br>Roll the dice each turn to trigger random events and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/137cdd48712e429b0f01afcff20bc098.avif?t=1761795945\" width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Equipment Drop Rate!</strong><br>Be on time for some steamy fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the entire hell and train the defiant monsters well \u2014 make them your loyal servants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/4d8921f6901fcf7a0c81de9045782fc1.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/4d8921f6901fcf7a0c81de9045782fc1.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/c31c88143a0b4b550c7e6a0531d5d8e5.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/c31c88143a0b4b550c7e6a0531d5d8e5.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>A pure love harem story \u2014 no NTR, no futanari, no \u201csomeone\u2019s mom\u201d scenes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Ioliane</strong>, a decadent demon noble ruling a remote corner of Hell. Through your... <i>\u201ccharisma\u201d</i>, you've created a land both orderly and depraved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, your trusty aide <strong>Juliet</strong> finds a runaway girl\u2014none other than <strong>Flora</strong>, the Demon King\u2019s daughter, fleeing a political marriage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With quick (and horny) thinking, you vow to escort her across the 18 layers of Hell\u2014not just to return her, but to <strong>propose</strong> to the Demon King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/4933adf8ec17fb45ad345a5b4bdd197d.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/4933adf8ec17fb45ad345a5b4bdd197d.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic <strong>one-hand-friendly board-game style</strong> returns!<br>Battle fierce monsters to collect powerful <strong>gear and materials</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>event cards</strong> or <strong>shop encounters</strong> to choose your growth path.<br>Distribute your resources wisely across the map \u2014 every round brings a <strong>freshly randomized Roguelike experience</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing a set number of laps, you\u2019ll unlock <strong>boss battles</strong> and <strong>special story events!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/9ae85004d8cccb9c9a5144abe0922148.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/9ae85004d8cccb9c9a5144abe0922148.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907210?t=1761795945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907210?t=1761795945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/0d2612323632c2c88b36363ed7b617739aa4bb49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761795945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/0d2612323632c2c88b36363ed7b617739aa4bb49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761795945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The characters appearing in this game are all adults aged 20 or over."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training \u00d7 Harem \u00d7 Board Game Madness!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps