210/extras/c31c88143a0b4b550c7e6a0531d5d8e5.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/c31c88143a0b4b550c7e6a0531d5d8e5.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>A pure love harem story \u2014 no NTR, no futanari, no \u201csomeone\u2019s mom\u201d scenes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Ioliane</strong>, a decadent demon noble ruling a remote corner of Hell. Through your... <i>\u201ccharisma\u201d</i>, you've created a land both orderly and depraved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, your trusty aide <strong>Juliet</strong> finds a runaway girl\u2014none other than <strong>Flora</strong>, the Demon King\u2019s daughter, fleeing a political marriage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With quick (and horny) thinking, you vow to escort her across the 18 layers of Hell\u2014not just to return her, but to <strong>propose</strong> to the Demon King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/4933adf8ec17fb45ad345a5b4bdd197d.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/4933adf8ec17fb45ad345a5b4bdd197d.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic <strong>one-hand-friendly board-game style</strong> returns!<br>Battle fierce monsters to collect powerful <strong>gear and materials</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>event cards</strong> or <strong>shop encounters</strong> to choose your growth path.<br>Distribute your resources wisely across the map \u2014 every round brings a <strong>freshly randomized Roguelike experience</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing a set number of laps, you\u2019ll unlock <strong>boss battles</strong> and <strong>special story events!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras/9ae85004d8cccb9c9a5144abe0922148.avif?t=1761795945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/extras_big/9ae85004d8cccb9c9a5144abe0922148.webp?t=1761795945 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["WorkNite Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907210/af72f77af81fdc6d596634217a21f146e9915ed3/header.jpg?t=1761795945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Married Into Hell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Alice Publication","Eternal Alice Media"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"1","descriptors":"Sexuelle Inhalte\nGewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"BANNED","rating_gen